  "file.round.added": "We added a hidden 'round' to the survey so that quality checks are blind. Collectors get this version when they join. You can still download the file you uploaded. Quality checks are blind only for collectors using the next Collect Earth release after 1.23.19: older versions show the plot's 'round' in Earth Map, the Google Earth Engine app and the plots map, so a collector can tell a check apart.",
