  "reference.ext.title": "Reference answers from a file",
  "reference.ext.explain": "Compare everyone's work with reference answers you already have, for example Collect Earth Online's reference data. Upload a CSV with a header row: the plot id first, as in the plot file, then one column per question, named as in the survey (its name or its label); or a JSON list of objects with “plot” and the questions. Choices may be codes or labels; blank cells give no answer.\n\nThe page then says which columns were taken and what was left out. Each person's latest submitted record of those plots is compared on the questions the file answers; a blank where the file has an answer counts as differing. A new file replaces the previous one.",
