  "design.explain": "No plot file yet? Give the area of interest (a GeoJSON file, or a zipped shapefile of polygons, in latitude and longitude) and the plots are laid out over it: at random, on a grid, or at random within strata. The plot file is then added as if you had uploaded it. Nothing is sent outside this server; elevation, slope and aspect are left at 0.",
