  "checks.divisionCol": "Copies from the division",
  "checks.whole": "These plot files are given whole, so they cannot hold checks: a check is a copy of one plot given to one more person, and a file given whole is not divided plot by plot. To use checks with them, give their plots one by one (divide them) on the Plot files page; they then appear in the table of plot files here and follow the rule. Files given whole: {files}",
