  "plot.reference": "This is a reference plot: {assessor}'s latest submitted first assessment is the reference, and every collector's check of it is measured against it. The results are under Reference plots on the Quality tab, per person and per question.\n\nThe plot is never decided, never in the review queue and never listed as a difference. Only coordinators see this page for a reference plot. To make it an ordinary plot again, remove it there; the checks already made then count as ordinary checks.",
