  "plots.unknownNames": "{name}: these names are not members of the project, so their rows were not given out: {names}",
  "plots.userColumnHint": "A column named user (a member's username or e-mail) gives each plot to that person, and a column named reviewers (members separated by ; or |) gives them its check. These columns are not kept in the file, so collectors are not told who checks their plots.\n\nThe names go in the header row, in upper or lower case; a plot on several rows takes its first row. A row that names anyone who is not a member is given to no one, and the upload lists those names. The file is then divided and has its own page. Dividing it again there replaces what the column gave out, except plots already submitted.",
  "plots.userColumnHint.short": "A user column gives each plot to that person; a reviewers column gives them its check.",
