  "analysis.help": "Click a bar or a row to look inside it (a land use → its subdivisions); at the last level, a click lists its plots: the first 200 are shown, and “Download them (Excel)” saves them all; where a plot's number is a link, it opens the plot's page in a new tab. Choose the questions in the bars above: what to count in “Show”, the rows and columns, the kind of chart and the order of the rows. The download icon above the table saves what you see as a CSV file for Excel.\n\n“More options” opens Perspective's own panel (drag and drop, formulas, colours); what you change there shows in the bars too.",
