  "analysis.shareExplain": "Everyone in this project will find it in the View menu under “Shared with the team”, in their own language: the questions and values are translated. A shared view with this name on this table is replaced. Collectors see it over their own plots, without a filter on “Assessment”, which their table has not.\n\nOnly coordinators share views and delete them (choose the view, then the bin icon); a project holds at most 200. To keep a view for yourself only, use “Save the view” instead: it stays in this browser.",
