  "backup.size": "About {size} to download.",
  "backup.noXml": "Left out because the server has no copy of the record as Collect Earth saved it: {count}.",
  "backup.measurements": "Measurements of reference plots left out: {count}. They are the collectors' assessments of a reference plot, measured against the reference rather than data of the plot, and they all have the plot's key, of which Collect Earth keeps one record only. The reference assessment itself is in the file. The data download (CSV) has every measurement, with yes in its reference column.",
  "backup.measurements.short": "Measurements of reference plots left out: {count} (the data download, CSV, has them).",
