  "copy.title": "Copy this project",
  "copy.intro": "Start a new project from this one: it gets the same survey (project file), the same plot files, the Progress settings (deadline, target, quiet days) and the quality settings (margins for numbers, the “very fast” threshold). Collected records, quality decisions, guidance notes, flags, checks drawn, reference plots and calibration and learning plots are not copied, and the AI assistant is off in the copy. This project does not change.\n\nType a name and press “Make the copy”. With the box ticked, the copy also gets the people with their roles and who does which plots, as the plot files were given or divided (without the check copies); without it, you are the only person in the copy. The copy starts as a draft, with you as its coordinator, and opens on its Setup tab. A closed or archived project can be copied too.",
  "copy.intro.short": "A new draft project with this one's survey, plot files and settings, but no collected data.",
