  "ai.title": "AI assistant",
  "ai.explain": "The assistant reads this project's quality figures and points out what to look at: questions that get mixed up, habits of a person, plots to check again. It never changes anything. The figures it shows come from this page, not from the AI.\n\nPress “Review with the AI assistant” and keep the page open: a review takes a few minutes. For each finding it can explain more, draft a guidance note (it opens for you to edit and save) or say which plots to check again, and you can ask it a question about the review. People's names are replaced by “Person A”, “Person B”; coordinates, comments and text answers are never sent. Earlier reviews stay listed under “Past reviews”.",
