  "person.submittedHelpSelf": "Plots you submitted.",
  "person.calendarExplainSelf": "Each square is a day, one column per week with Monday at the top, from your first day with a submission (at most a year back) to today, which has an outline. The darker the square, the more plots you first submitted that day, in four steps up to your busiest day; the palest means none. It shows the days worked, not the hours: those are under “Hours of the day”.\n\nPoint at a square, or select the calendar and use the arrow keys, to read the day's figures; “Table” lists every day with a submission. Days are those of your time zone, {zone}.",
