  "queue.bulkTitle": "Decide many plots at once",
  "queue.bulkExplain": "For checks that differ and have no decision, when one side was done by a reviewer or a coordinator and the other side was not, by their roles now. “Take the first assessment where it is a reviewer's” decides “First is right” for those plots; “Take the check where it is a reviewer's” decides “Check is right”.\n\nEach button first says how many plots it would decide and names some of them; nothing is decided until you confirm. Plots that already have a decision stay as they are, and reference plots are never decided. Each decision made this way can be undone one by one with “Undo” on its plot.",
  "queue.bulkExplain.short": "For differing checks without a decision, done by a reviewer or coordinator on one side only.",
