  "map.heading": "Map of progress",
  "map.intro": "Each plot of the plot files is drawn at its latitude and longitude, with the colour and shape of its status (see Plots per status below). Click a plot for its id, its status and a link to its page; coordinators also see who it is given to. Once the map has the focus, move it with the arrow keys and zoom with + and −; “Show the plots as a list” gives the same plots as links.\n\n“Plot file” (and, for coordinators, “Person”) narrows the map, and the counts below follow the same choice. Untick a status in the table below to hide it, for example to see only the plots not started. The map does not update by itself: press “Load again” to see the plots saved since.",
  "map.intro.short": "Each plot at its place, drawn by how far it has got. Click a plot to see its status and open its page.",
