  "map.loading": "Loading the plots: {loaded} of {total}…",
  "map.unsupportedSrs": "The survey's first coordinate system is {srs}, not latitude and longitude. Collect Earth converts such coordinates itself, but this map does not, so no plot can be placed on it. The table below still counts the plots per status, and the plot file and person filters still apply to it. To see where the plots are, open them in Collect Earth; to find one plot here, type its id in the search box at the top of the page.",
  "map.unsupportedSrs.short": "The survey's coordinates are in {srs}, so this map cannot place the plots. The table below counts them.",
  "map.noFigures": "Two statuses come from the quality figures: “Differs from a check, not decided” and “Submitted again, waiting for a look”. None have been worked out since the server started, so until then those plots show as “Submitted, no decision” and “Sent back for another look”; decisions already made are shown.\n\nTo get them, open the Quality tab, which works the figures out, then come back here and press “Load again”.",
