  "map.notOnMap.more": "A plot is placed from its row in the plot file: the column right after the id columns is read as the latitude (−90 to 90) and the next one as the longitude (−180 to 180), as Collect Earth reads them; a decimal comma is accepted. A plot whose values there are empty, not numbers or out of range is counted in the table but not drawn. The plot files concerned are listed below, with how many of their plots are missing; check those two columns in the file.",
