  "map.placingStart": "Placing the plots on the map…",
  "map.submittedNote": "Five statuses are plots with a submitted first assessment: “Submitted, no decision”, “Accepted (decided)”, “Sent back for another look”, “Submitted again, waiting for a look” and “Differs from a check, not decided”. Together they are the plots the Progress tab counts as submitted. A plot moves between them as it is decided in the review queue: “First is right” or “Check is right” makes it accepted, “Both need another look” sends it back.\n\nThe counts follow the filters above and include the plots without a latitude and longitude, which are not on the map.",
  "map.submittedNote.short": "The statuses of submitted plots add up to what the Progress tab counts as submitted.",
