  "activity.logTitle": "What happened",
  "activity.logHelp": "What Collect Earth sent and what coordinators did, the newest first. People and plot files are named as they are called now.",
  "activity.logHelp.more": "Each row is one save Collect Earth sent, of a plot or of a quality check (submitted, submitted again, saved without submitting, changed after submitting, deleted), or one thing a coordinator did, such as a decision, a plot file, a setting or a download. Rows about a plot, a save or a decision, have “Open the plot”.\n\nNarrow the list with Person, What and the From and To days; each change loads the list again from the newest row, and “Show everything” clears the filters. 50 rows are shown at a time: “Show older ones” adds the next 50 below. Person lists the people in the project now: someone removed can no longer be chosen.",
