  "activity.more": "Show older ones",
  "activity.timesNote": "Times are in your time zone. A plot's time is when it was saved on the collector's computer, not when it reached the server: Collect Earth may send it later. A coordinator's action has the time the server did it.\n\nThe list is ordered by these times, and the From and To filters use them too (whole days in your time zone, both days included). So a plot sent late appears at the time it was saved, below newer rows, not at the top: if you are waiting for someone's plots, choose that person and the days they worked.",
  "activity.timesNote.short": "Times are in your time zone; a plot's is when it was saved on the collector's computer.",
