  "activity.openQuality": "Open the Quality tab",
  "activity.noFigures": "The Differences table is made from the quality figures, the same ones the Quality tab shows, and none have been worked out since the server last started. Open the Quality tab: it starts working them out and shows them when they are ready. Then come back here and press “Differences” again.\n\nIf the figures at hand are older than the latest saves, the table follows them, and newer ones are worked out meanwhile. A pair whose record was deleted, or whose answers no longer differ, since those figures is still listed, with a note in the Question column.",
